 "goal": "结合后缀和句法位置辨认词性。",
 "skill": "阅读",
 "exam": "大学英语四级（CET-4）",
 "mastery": "once",
 "points": [
  {
   "id": "suffix",
   "label": "根据常见后缀辨认候选词性"
  },
  {
   "id": "context",
   "label": "用句法位置核对同根词的选择"
  }
 ],
 "sources": [
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "title": "全国大学英语四、六级考试大纲（2016年修订版）",
   "url": "https://cet.neea.edu.cn/res/Home/1704/55b02330ac17274664f06d9d3db8249d.pdf",
   "used": "词汇理解教学依据"
  }
 ],
 "cards": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "text",
   "title": "概述",
   "body": [
    {
     "p": "同根词可以有不同的词性。后缀是判断词性的线索，最后还要看空位在句中的位置。They develop a plan 中，develop 是动词。the development of a plan 中，development 是名词。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "nouns",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "名词后缀",
   "cols": [
    "词组",
    "词性与意义",
    "例"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "develop / development",
     "动词：发展；名词：发展",
     "The development of the garden took time."
    ],
    [
     "improve / improvement",
     "动词：改善；名词：改善",
     "The improvement made travel easier."
    ],
    [
     "arrange / arrangement",
     "动词：安排；名词：安排",
     "The arrangement saved space."
    ],
    [
     "educate / education",
     "动词：教育；名词：教育",
     "Education helps people learn."
    ],
    [
     "organize / organization",
     "动词：组织；名词：组织",
     "The organization offers classes."
    ],
    [
     "decide / decision",
     "动词：决定；名词：决定",
     "The decision changed the plan."
    ],
    [
     "discuss / discussion",
     "动词：讨论；名词：讨论",
     "The discussion lasted an hour."
    ],
    [
     "create / creation",
     "动词：创造；名词：创造",
     "The creation of the garden took work."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "verbs",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "动词后缀",
   "cols": [
    "词组",
    "词性与意义",
    "例"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "modern / modernize",
     "形容词：现代的；动词：使现代化",
     "The library plans to modernize its catalog."
    ],
    [
     "simple / simplify",
     "形容词：简单的；动词：简化",
     "The editor will simplify the instructions."
    ],
    [
     "class / classify",
     "名词：类别；动词：分类",
     "Scientists classify the samples."
    ],
    [
     "active / activate",
     "形容词：活跃的；动词：启动",
     "The switch will activate the light."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "modifiers",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "形容词和副词后缀",
   "cols": [
    "词组",
    "词性与意义",
    "例"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "help / helpful",
     "名词：帮助；形容词：有帮助的",
     "The guide gave helpful advice."
    ],
    [
     "use / useful / useless",
     "名词：用途；形容词：有用的 / 无用的",
     "The map is useful."
    ],
    [
     "care / careful / careless",
     "名词：小心；形容词：仔细的 / 粗心的",
     "A careful driver checks the road."
    ],
    [
     "slow / slowly",
     "形容词：慢的；副词：缓慢地",
     "The river flows slowly."
    ],
    [
     "clear / clearly",
     "形容词：清楚的；副词：清楚地",
     "The teacher spoke clearly."
    ]
   ],
   "note": "少数以 -ly 结尾的词是形容词，如 a friendly neighbor 中的 friendly。"
  },
  {
